{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22083","headline":"新乐府 官牛\t\t讽执政也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 官牛\t\t讽执政也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官牛官牛驾官车，滻水岸边般载沙。\n一石沙，几斤重，朝载暮载将何用。\n载向五门官道西，绿槐阴下铺沙堤。\n昨来新拜右丞相，恐怕泥涂汚马蹄。\n右丞相，马蹄蹋沙虽净洁，牛领牵车欲流血。\n右丞相，但能济人治国调阴阳，官牛领穿亦无妨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}